    "Motif unit fixtures T01-Tnn (Planning/milestones/M2.md §9; T42 onward PostM2_EM1.md §9). Label unit; no engine.",
    "Each fixture: id, title, source ('<game>, before <move>' from the Captain's PGN via chesswhy-pgn, 'lichess:<id>' (CC0), or 'constructed'), fen, line_uci (moves from fen; may be empty), includes, excludes.",
    "An instance: tag (report spelling), side ('white'|'black', the side the motif benefits), ply (0 = fen, k = after the k-th move of line_uci), actor (square, e.g. 'e5'), targets (squares, in the order the motif reports them); pin_tactical includes also give threat {kind, square}.",
    "includes: each instance must appear in position_motifs(fen) (ply 0) or line_motifs(fen, line_uci) (ply >= 1) with exactly these fields (threat compared when given).",
    "excludes: no instance may match; omitted fields match anything (e.g. {tag, side, ply} forbids every such motif at that ply).",
    "T01-T41 proposed by M2 WP5 and frozen after the Captain's review (M2 §12, checkpoint 1); T42-T53 (pin_tactical) frozen with the PostM2_EM1 batch 3 contract (2026-10-21); T54-T56 added at the PostM2_EM1 gate (§15)."
